            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. It is the unit member's responsibility to maintain and clean the uniforms. Exceptions will be made for those classifications that through the nature of the daily work, the uniforms become inordinately soiled and dirty. For those classifications the Board will supply laundering. Employees in these classifications will initially be issued more than five (5) uniforms if necessary to provide a daily change.",
            "block_bbox": [
                69,
                334,
