        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "C. Uniforms will be of quality material, design, and manufacture. A committee of four (4) Board representatives and four (4) MCCSSE representatives shall meet periodically at the call of either party to consider and make recommendations to the Board on the selection, problems or issues concerning uniforms.",
