        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A. MCCSSE and the Board of Education recognize the vital importance of training and education in this era of change. A well-trained, effectively functioning work force is necessary if the Montgomery County Public Schools is to achieve its goal of providing quality education for every student. The Board recognizes the need for programs which will improve the efficiency of unit members in their current jobs and the importance of assisting unit members to meet Montgomery County Public Schools employment needs along with the unit member's individual career development plans.",
            "block_bbox": [
                69,
                724,
                724,
                921
